    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(1) Introduction to the game This is a casual story - based game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > You take part in the company's daily work. Just click on the computer to work (play small games). </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Playing these small games can get you gold coins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > You use the gold coins to unlock and move the story forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Players can walk around in different places. This will start different parts of the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > (2) Small game gameplay Use the wasd keys on the keyboard to move around.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Control well. The more layers there are under the ball, the better. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll get your rewards when the timer runs out.</p>",
